- catalog/providers.json: model and price data from models.dev (MIT,
  https://github.com/anomalyco/models.dev). Anthropic-compatible endpoints and balance endpoints
  in catalog/curated.json come from cc-switch (MIT, https://github.com/farion1231/cc-switch);
  every entry cites its file and line.
- Geist and Geist Mono fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1), bundled through @fontsource.
- Design and architecture ideas from OrchestratorInc/agent-orchestrator and BloopAI/vibe-kanban
  (Apache-2.0). No code has been copied from them; any future port keeps its license header and
  gets an entry here.
- packages/adapter-codex/src/protocol/: TypeScript types generated by `codex app-server generate-ts`
  from openai/codex (Apache-2.0, https://github.com/openai/codex). Generated, not hand-copied; each
  file names the codex version it came from.
